<title>ESTONIA: NORMA, ESS TO GET BOURSE LISTING. [CORRECTED 16:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>NORMA, ESS TO GET BOURSE LISTING. [CORRECTED 16:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tallinn bourse said on Tuesday that diversified industrialist Norma will be listed on the main list of the bourse from August 5.</p>
<p>Leading security company ESS will be listed on the secondary list of the bourse from August 5, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>Norma shares are already traded on the free market of the bourse.</p>
<p>(Corrects to read that the companies will be listed from August 5).</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
